@startuml
title "DS_01_INICIALIZAR_CLIENTE_REST"
autonumber

actor "Usuario" as Usuario
participant "CONVERSION_VISTA" as Vista
participant "LOGIN_CONTROLADOR" as Controlador
participant "CLIENTE_REST_CONVERSOR\n(ConversorService)" as ClienteRest
participant "API_REST_CONVERSOR\n(/api/auth/login)" as ApiRest
participant "ADMINISTRADOR_CREDENCIALES" as Credenciales
participant "ADMINISTRADOR_TOKEN" as Tokens

Usuario -> Vista: Ingresa credenciales (MONSTER / MONSTER9)
Vista -> Controlador: login(usuario, contrasenia)
Controlador -> ClienteRest: autenticar(usuario, contrasenia)
activate ClienteRest

ClienteRest -> ApiRest: HTTP POST /api/auth/login\nContent-Type: application/json\n{"usuario": "MONSTER", "contrasenia": "MONSTER9"}
activate ApiRest

ApiRest -> Credenciales: validarUsuario(usuario, contrasenia)
activate Credenciales
Credenciales --> ApiRest: true (credenciales correctas)
deactivate Credenciales

ApiRest -> Tokens: generarToken()
activate Tokens
Tokens --> ApiRest: token (UUID)
deactivate Tokens

ApiRest --> ClienteRest: HTTP 200 OK\n{"token": "uuid-token", "usuario": "MONSTER"}
deactivate ApiRest

ClienteRest -> ClienteRest: guardarToken(token)\npara cabecera Authorization: Bearer
ClienteRest --> Controlador: LoginResponse(token, usuario)
deactivate ClienteRest
Controlador --> Vista: mostrarMenuPrincipal()
Vista --> Usuario: Interfaz de conversion habilitada
@enduml